WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:02.670
Hi there! I’m Anna.

2
00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:04.990
Hi, Anna. I’m Anne.

3
00:00:05.540 --> 00:00:07.410
Nice to meet you. What are you doing?

4
00:00:07.720 --> 00:00:08.670
Um, I’m writing.

5
00:00:09.100 --> 00:00:12.310
You are writing! You are writing a lot!

6
00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:14.030
Oh! Oh dear.

7
00:00:13.880 --> 00:00:15.830
No! No! That's okay.

8
00:00:15.680 --> 00:00:16.330
I am sorry!

9
00:00:16.180 --> 00:00:17.050
That’s okay. Really.

10
00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:17.610
I am sorry!

11
00:00:17.460 --> 00:00:20.910
Please. Please. Please stop. Please.

12
00:00:23.640 --> 00:00:26.850
Sorry. Sorry.

13
00:00:50.960 --> 00:00:58.270
“and people all around the world are waiting to hear news about the next president…”

14
00:00:58.120 --> 00:01:01.790
Jonathan, hi! Remember me? I live in your building.

15
00:01:02.220 --> 00:01:04.190
Oh. Uh. Hi, Anna.

16
00:01:04.360 --> 00:01:05.610
What are you doing?

17
00:01:05.900 --> 00:01:07.930
I am doing my show!

18
00:01:08.620 --> 00:01:11.290
Oh, sorry. Are you recording?

19
00:01:11.670 --> 00:01:15.230
Yes! And, now I have to record again!

20
00:01:16.520 --> 00:01:17.750
Sorry. Have a good show.

21
00:01:18.360 --> 00:01:19.110
Thank you.

22
00:01:19.680 --> 00:01:20.270
Sorry.

23
00:01:27.480 --> 00:01:29.930
The word of the day is social.

24
00:01:31.040 --> 00:01:31.190
Social -

25
00:01:31.040 --> 00:01:32.530
- is an adjective.

26
00:01:32.380 --> 00:01:33.690
Oh! Hi!

27
00:01:33.540 --> 00:01:34.070
Hi! I’m Anna!

28
00:01:34.440 --> 00:01:35.630
Hi. I’m Amelia.

29
00:01:35.980 --> 00:01:36.950
Nice to meet you!

30
00:01:37.820 --> 00:01:38.830
What are you doing?

31
00:01:39.980 --> 00:01:40.690
I’m reading.

32
00:01:41.140 --> 00:01:43.590
Are you reading the news? Hi!

33
00:01:43.980 --> 00:01:46.510
No, I’m reading for my show.

34
00:01:49.640 --> 00:01:50.870
Can I read again?

35
00:01:51.920 --> 00:01:52.570
Sorry.

36
00:01:54.200 --> 00:01:56.930
This day is not going well.
